# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; never commit real values.
#
# Finland (MML Korkeusmalli 2 m) needs no credentials at all — it is served
# from the Funet/CSC open mirror. Only Sweden requires an account.
#
# Sweden — Lantmäteriet Markhöjdmodell Nedladdning (free, CC BY 4.0).
# Register at https://geotorget.lantmateriet.se and ORDER the product
# "Markhöjdmodell Nedladdning". Geotorget issues credentials per ordered
# product: credentials for another Lantmäteriet dataset will authenticate but
# return 403 here. Use the pair issued for this product.
LANTMATERIET_USER=
LANTMATERIET_PASSWORD=

# Optional: load credentials from somewhere else instead of this file.
# BUNKER_SCANNER_ENV_FILE=/path/to/other/.env
